<headroom-library version="1" id="metal-modern-tight" category="High Gain" order="10" instrument="guitar" style="Metal">
  <description>The modern metal rhythm recipe: a gate, an overdrive with its drive at zero tightening the low end, into a 120-watt high-gain lead channel and a 4x12. Saturated, tight palm mutes, chords that stay defined. Drop tunings welcome.</description>
